n","ax1.axvline(x=0, color='black', linewidth=1.2, linestyle='--')\n","ax1.set_xlabel('Valor del Coeficiente', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax1.set_title('Regresion Lineal: Coeficientes\\n(verde=sube tarifa | rojo=baja tarifa)',\n","              fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax1.tick_params(axis='y', labelsize=9)\n","ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='x', linestyle='--')\n","\n","for bar, val in zip(bars, coeficientes):\n","    ax1.text(val + (0.2 if val >= 0 else -0.2),\n","             bar.get_y() + bar.get_height() / 2,\n","             f'{val:.2f}', va='center',\n","             ha='left' if val >= 0 else 'right', fontsize=8)\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# Grafica 7B: Importancia de Variables Arbol de Decision\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","ax2 = axes[1]\n","\n","imp_data  = sorted(zip(X_train.columns, modelo_ad.feature_importances_),\n","                   key=lambda x: x[1])\n","vars_imp  = [x[0] for x in imp_data]\n","vals_imp  = [x[1] for x in imp_data]\n","colores_imp = ['#1f77b4' if v < 0.5 else '#ff7f0e' for v in vals_imp]\n","\n","bars2 = ax2.barh(vars_imp, vals_imp, color=colores_imp,\n","                 edgecolor='black', linewidth=0.8, alpha=0.85)\n","ax2.set_xlabel('Importancia Relativa', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax2.set_title('Arbol de Decision: Importancia de Variables\\n(naranja=dominante)',\n","              fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax2.tick_params(axis='y', labelsize=9)\n","ax2.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='x', linestyle='--')\n","\n","for bar, val in zip(bars2, vals_imp):\n","    ax2.text(val + 0.005, bar.get_y() + bar.get_height() / 2,\n","             f'{val*100:.1f}%', va='center', fontsize=8)\n","\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.savefig('07_interpretacion_modelos.png', dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n","plt.show()\n","print(\"Figura 7 guardada: 07_interpretacion_modelos.png\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":626},"id":"umyAF0sF5_nG","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1779423513384,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":2425,"user":{"displayName":"JUAN CAMILO HERRERA OSORIO","userId":"01740464591269688400"}},"outputId":"4c3978bf-c634-4a33-d9df-ccb6d7ee4fee"},"execution_count":140,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1600x600 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Figura 7 guardada: 07_interpretacion_modelos.png\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## FASE 4: INTERPRETACIÓN DE MODELOS\n","\n","---\n","\n","### Modelo 1: Regresión Lineal — Interpretación de Coeficientes\n","\n","El intercepto de **$19.32** representa la tarifa base cuando todas las\n","variables predictoras son cero (punto de referencia del modelo).\n","\n","**Variables con mayor impacto positivo** (aumentan la tarifa):\n","\n","| Variable | Coeficiente | Interpretación |\n","|---|---|---|\n","| `distancia` | +9.99 | Por cada milla adicional, la tarifa sube ~$10 |\n","| `propina` | +1.31 | A mayor propina registrada, mayor tarifa total |\n","| `municipio_recogida_Brooklyn` | +0.36 | Recogidas en Brooklyn tienen tarifa ligeramente mayor |\n","| `color_yellow` | +0.34 | Taxis amarillos cobran marginalmente más que los verdes |\n","\n","**Variables con mayor impacto negativo** (reducen la tarifa):\n","\n","| Variable | Coeficiente | Interpretación |\n","|---|---|---|\n","| `municipio_destino_Staten Island` | -12.90 | Destinos a Staten Island tienen tarifas menores al promedio base |\n","| `municipio_destino_Queens` | -4.78 | Destinos a Queens reducen la tarifa estimada |\n","| `municipio_destino_Manhattan` | -4.73 | Destinos a Manhattan reducen la tarifa estimada |\n","| `metodo_pago_credit card` | -1.28 | Pagos con tarjeta asociados a tarifas ligeramente menores |\n","| `es_fin_semana` | -0.58 | Los fines de semana las tarifas son levemente menores |\n","\n","> **Nota:** `tiene_peaje` tiene coeficiente 0.0 — no aportó información\n","> útil al modelo lineal, posiblemente por baja variabilidad en los datos.\n","\n","---\n","\n","### Modelo 2: Árbol de Decisión — Importancia de Variables\n","\n","El árbol de decisión con profundidad 6 generó **51 hojas**, lo que indica\n","un modelo moderadamente complejo.\n","\n","| Variable | Importancia | Interpretación |\n","|---|---|---|\n","| `distancia` | 93.95% | Variable dominante — casi toda la predicción depende de ella |\n","| `propina` | 4.79% | Segunda variable más relevante |\n","| `hora` | 0.70% | Aporte marginal — hora del día tiene poco peso |\n","| `metodo_pago_credit card` | 0.31% | Aporte mínimo |\n","| `pasajeros` | 0.11% | Practicamente irrelevante para el modelo |\n","\n","---\n","\n","### Conclusión Comparativa (previa a métricas)\n","\n","Ambos modelos coinciden en que **`distancia` es el predictor principal**\n","de la tarifa, lo cual es consistente con la lógica del negocio.\n","\n","La Regresión Lineal distribuye el peso entre más variables, mientras que\n","el Árbol de Decisión concentra el 94% de su capacidad predictiva en\n","`distancia` — lo que puede indicar sobreajuste a esa variable o que\n","las demás realmente aportan poco una vez controlada la distancia.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"Ld0tQeWO5TKG"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## FASE 5: EVALUATION\n","\n","---\n","\n","Se evaluan ambos modelos sobre el conjunto de prueba (20%) usando las\n","métricas definidas en el Business Understanding:\n","\n","- **R²** — proporcion de varianza explicada por el modelo (entre 0 y 1)\n","- **MAE** — error promedio absoluto en USD\n","- **RMSE** — raiz del error cuadratico medio (penaliza errores grandes)\n","\n","Se elige el mejor modelo basandose en los criterios de exito definidos:\n","R² >= 0.65 y MAE < $3.50.\n","\n","Se analiza ademas un potencial sesgo etico del dataset o del modelo."],"metadata":{"id":"OXVie3df6aIO"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from sklearn.metrics import r2_score, mean_absolute_error, mean_squared_error\n","\n","print(\"=\" * 90)\n","print(\"FASE 5: EVALUATION\")\n","print(\"-\" * 90)\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 5.1 PREDICCIONES\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","y_pred_rl = modelo_rl.predict(X_test)\n","y_pred_ad = modelo_ad.predict(X_test)\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 5.2 METRICAS\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","print(\"\\n5.2 METRICAS DE RENDIMIENTO\\n\")\n","\n","r2_rl   = r2_score(y_test, y_pred_rl)\n","mae_rl  = mean_absolute_error(y_test, y_pred_rl)\n","rmse_rl = mean_squared_error(y_test, y_pred_rl) ** 0.5\n","\n","r2_ad   = r2_score(y_test, y_pred_ad)\n","mae_ad  = mean_absolute_error(y_test, y_pred_ad)\n","rmse_ad = mean_squared_error(y_test, y_pred_ad) ** 0.5\n","\n","print(f\"  {'Metrica':<10} {'Regresion Lineal':>20} {'Arbol de Decision':>20} {'Criterio':>15}\")\n","print(f\"  {'-'*70}\")\n","print(f\"  {'R²':<10} {r2_rl:>20.4f} {r2_ad:>20.4f} {'>= 0.65':>15}\")\n","print(f\"  {'MAE':<10} {mae_rl:>19.4f} {mae_ad:>20.4f} {'< $3.50':>15}\")\n","print(f\"  {'RMSE':<10} {rmse_rl:>19.4f} {rmse_ad:>20.4f} {'minimizado':>15}\")\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 5.3 CUMPLIMIENTO DE CRITERIOS\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","print(\"\\n5.3 CUMPLIMIENTO DE CRITERIOS DE EXITO\\n\")\n","\n","print(\"  Regresion Lineal:\")\n","print(f\"    R²  >= 0.65 : {'CUMPLE' if r2_rl >= 0.65 else 'NO CUMPLE'} ({r2_rl:.4f})\")\n","print(f\"    MAE < $3.50 : {'CUMPLE' if mae_rl < 3.50 else 'NO CUMPLE'} (${mae_rl:.4f})\")\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"  Arbol de Decision:\")\n","print(f\"    R²  >= 0.65 : {'CUMPLE' if r2_ad >= 0.65 else 'NO CUMPLE'} ({r2_ad:.4f})\")\n","print(f\"    MAE < $3.50 : {'CUMPLE' if mae_ad < 3.50 else 'NO CUMPLE'} (${mae_ad:.4f})\")\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 5.4 ELECCION DEL MEJOR MODELO\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","print(\"\\n5.4 ELECCION DEL MEJOR MODELO\\n\")\n","\n","if r2_ad > r2_rl:\n","    mejor = \"Arbol de Decision\"\n","    r2_mejor  = r2_ad\n","    mae_mejor = mae_ad\n","else:\n","    mejor = \"Regresion Lineal\"\n","    r2_mejor  = r2_rl\n","    mae_mejor = mae_rl\n","\n","print(f\"  Modelo seleccionado: {mejor}\")\n","print(f\"  R²  : {r2_mejor:.4f}\")\n","print(f\"  MAE : ${mae_mejor:.4f}\")\n","print()\n","print(\"  Justificacion:\")\n","print(f\"    El {mejor} obtuvo el mayor R² y menor error en el conjunto de prueba.\")\n","print(\"    Ambos modelos coinciden en que 'distancia' es el predictor principal.\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"YtpB65pd6eYv","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1779423638136,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":3,"user":{"displayName":"JUAN CAMILO HERRERA OSORIO","userId":"01740464591269688400"}},"outputId":"ed65b27e-9ba5-433f-a7a6-a096b5d4b28f"},"execution_count":141,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["==========================================================================================\n","FASE 5: EVALUATION\n","------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","\n","5.2 METRICAS DE RENDIMIENTO\n","\n","  Metrica        Regresion Lineal    Arbol de Decision        Criterio\n","  ----------------------------------------------------------------------\n","  R²                       0.8621               0.9023         >= 0.65\n","  MAE                     1.9862               1.8458         < $3.50\n","  RMSE                    4.1816               3.5203      minimizado\n","\n","5.3 CUMPLIMIENTO DE CRITERIOS DE EXITO\n","\n","  Regresion Lineal:\n","    R²  >= 0.65 : CUMPLE (0.8621)\n","    MAE < $3.50 : CUMPLE ($1.9862)\n","\n","  Arbol de Decision:\n","    R²  >= 0.65 : CUMPLE (0.9023)\n","    MAE < $3.50 : CUMPLE ($1.8458)\n","\n","5.4 ELECCION DEL MEJOR MODELO\n","\n","  Modelo seleccionado: Arbol de Decision\n","  R²  : 0.9023\n","  MAE : $1.8458\n","\n","  Justificacion:\n","    El Arbol de Decision obtuvo el mayor R² y menor error en el conjunto de prueba.\n","    Ambos modelos coinciden en que 'distancia' es el predictor principal.\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(18, 5))\n","fig.suptitle('Figura 8. Evaluacion de Modelos: Prediccion vs Valor Real',\n","             fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 8A: Prediccion vs Real - Regresion Lineal\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","ax1 = axes[0]\n","ax1.scatter(y_test, y_pred_rl, alpha=0.4, s=20, color='steelblue', label='Predicciones')\n","lim = [min(y_test.min(), y_pred_rl.min()), max(y_test.max(), y_pred_rl.max())]\n","ax1.plot(lim, lim, 'r--', linewidth=2, label='Prediccion perfecta')\n","ax1.set_xlabel('Valor Real (USD)', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax1.set_ylabel('Valor Predicho (USD)', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax1.set_title(f'Regresion Lineal\\nR²={r2_rl:.4f} | MAE=${mae_rl:.2f}',\n","              fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax1.legend(fontsize=9)\n","ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3, linestyle='--')\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 8B: Prediccion vs Real - Arbol de Decision\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","ax2 = axes[1]\n","ax2.scatter(y_test, y_pred_ad, alpha=0.4, s=20, color='#2ca02c', label='Predicciones')\n","ax2.plot(lim, lim, 'r--', linewidth=2, label='Prediccion perfecta')\n","ax2.set_xlabel('Valor Real (USD)', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax2.set_ylabel('Valor Predicho (USD)', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax2.set_title(f'Arbol de Decision\\nR²={r2_ad:.4f} | MAE=${mae_ad:.2f}',\n","              fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax2.legend(fontsize=9)\n","ax2.grid(True, alpha=0.3, linestyle='--')\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 8C: Comparacion de metricas\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","ax3 = axes[2]\n","metricas  = ['R²', 'MAE', 'RMSE']\n","vals_rl   = [r2_rl, mae_rl, rmse_rl]\n","vals_ad   = [r2_ad, mae_ad, rmse_ad]\n","x         = np.arange(len(metricas))\n","width     = 0.35\n","\n","b1 = ax3.bar(x - width/2, vals_rl, width, label='Regresion Lineal',\n","             color='steelblue', alpha=0.85, edgecolor='black')\n","b2 = ax3.bar(x + width/2, vals_ad, width, label='Arbol de Decision',\n","             color='#2ca02c', alpha=0.85, edgecolor='black')\n","\n","ax3.set_xticks(x)\n","ax3.set_xticklabels(metricas, fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n","ax3.set_title('Comparacion de Metricas', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n","ax3.legend(fontsize=10)\n","ax3.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='y', linestyle='--')\n","\n","for bar in list(b1) + list(b2):\n","    ax3.text(bar.get_x() + bar.get_width()/2., bar.get_height(),\n","             f'{bar.get_height():.3f}', ha='center', va='bottom', fontsize=9)\n","\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.savefig('08_evaluacion_modelos.png', dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n","plt.show()\n","print(\"Figura 8 guardada: 08_evaluacion_modelos.png\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":528},"id":"_qlH-Sf76tF-","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1779423704169,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":6337,"user":{"displayName":"JUAN CAMILO HERRERA OSORIO","userId":"01740464591269688400"}},"outputId":"b3f21222-79fd-4562-b5e3-7057826373ca"},"execution_count":142,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1800x500 with 3 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Figura 8 guardada: 08_evaluacion_modelos.png\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## FASE 5: ÉTICA Y SESGOS\n","\n","---\n","\n","El análisis ético evalúa si el modelo o el dataset pueden generar\n","predicciones injustas o discriminatorias hacia ciertos grupos.\n","\n","Se analizan tres dimensiones:\n","\n","- **Sesgo geografico** — ¿el modelo predice distinto segun el barrio?\n","- **Sesgo por metodo de pago** — ¿hay diferencia entre efectivo y tarjeta?\n","- **Sesgo por tipo de taxi** — ¿taxis amarillos vs verdes reciben trato distinto?"],"metadata":{"id":"boHNSpbf7Khm"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["print(\"=\" * 90)\n","print(\"FASE 5: ETICA Y SESGOS\")\n","print(\"-\" * 90)\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 5.5 SESGO GEOGRAFICO\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","print(\"\\n5.5 SESGO GEOGRAFICO\\n\")\n","\n","df_eval = X_test.copy()\n","df_eval['tarifa_real']    = y_test.values\n","df_eval['pred_rl']        = y_pred_rl\n","df_eval['pred_ad']        = y_pred_ad\n","df_eval['error_rl']       = abs(df_eval['tarifa_real'] - df_eval['pred_rl'])\n","df_eval['error_ad']       = abs(df_eval['tarifa_real'] - df_eval['pred_ad'])\n","\n","# Recuperar municipio desde las columnas OHE\n","def recuperar_municipio(row, prefijo):\n","    cols = [c for c in row.index if c.startswith(prefijo)]\n","    for c in cols:\n","        if row[c] == 1:\n","            return c.replace(prefijo, '')\n","    return 'Bronx'  # categoria base (drop_first)\n","\n","df_eval['municipio_recogida'] = df_eval.apply(\n","    lambda r: recuperar_municipio(r, 'municipio_recogida_'), axis=1)\n","\n","error_geo_rl = df_eval.groupby('municipio_recogida')['error_rl'].mean().round(3)\n","error_geo_ad = df_eval.groupby('municipio_recogida')['error_ad'].mean().round(3)\n","\n","print(\"  Error promedio (MAE) por municipio de recogida:\")\n","print(f\"  {'Municipio':<25} {'Reg. Lineal':>15} {'Arbol Decision':>15}\")\n","print(f\"  {'-'*55}\")\n","for mun in error_geo_rl.index:\n","    print(f\"  {mun:<25} {error_geo_rl[mun]:>14.3f} {error_geo_ad[mun]:>15.3f}\")\n","\n","diferencia_rl = error_geo_rl.max() - error_geo_rl.min()\n","diferencia_ad = error_geo_ad.max() - error_geo_ad.min()\n","print()\n","print(f\"  Diferencia max-min Reg. Lineal : ${diferencia_rl:.3f}\")\n","print(f\"  Diferencia max-min Arbol Dec.  : ${diferencia_ad:.3f}\")\n","if diferencia_rl > 2 or diferencia_ad > 2:\n","    print(\"  ALERTA: diferencia > $2 entre municipios — posible sesgo geografico.\")\n","else:\n","    print(\"  El error es relativamente uniforme entre municipios.\")\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 5.6 SESGO POR METODO DE PAGO\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","print(\"\\n5.6 SESGO POR METODO DE PAGO\\n\")\n","\n","df_eval['metodo_pago'] = df_eval['metodo_pago_credit card'].map(\n","    {1: 'Tarjeta', 0: 'Efectivo'})\n","\n","error_pago_rl = df_eval.groupby('metodo_pago')['error_rl'].mean().round(3)\n","error_pago_ad = df_eval.groupby('metodo_pago')['error_ad'].mean().round(3)\n","\n","print(f\"  {'Metodo de Pago':<20} {'Reg. Lineal':>15} {'Arbol Decision':>15}\")\n","print(f\"  {'-'*50}\")\n","for pago in error_pago_rl.index:\n","    print(f\"  {pago:<20} {error_pago_rl[pago]:>14.3f} {error_pago_ad[pago]:>15.3f}\")\n","\n","dif_pago_rl = abs(error_pago_rl['Tarjeta'] - error_pago_rl['Efectivo'])\n","dif_pago_ad = abs(error_pago_ad['Tarjeta'] - error_pago_ad['Efectivo'])\n","print()\n","print(f\"  Diferencia Reg. Lineal : ${dif_pago_rl:.3f}\")\n","print(f\"  Diferencia Arbol Dec.  : ${dif_pago_ad:.3f}\")\n","if dif_pago_rl > 1 or dif_pago_ad > 1:\n","    print(\"  ALERTA: diferencia > $1